## Shared system account (no manager, top of hierarchy)
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# System Account — a shared system / service account for the sample organisation.
#   Role: system-administrator (a system-level role, not a person-in-the-firm role).
#   Reports to: nobody — top of hierarchy (same as the CEO).
#   Geographic: London, Greater London, UK (the firm's home base).
#   Note: this account is used for system-level operations in the sample (e.g. service-to-service
#   calls, automated processes). It is not a person; it has no manager and no reporting line.
#   It carries the system-administrator employeeType so the sample can demonstrate the
#   system-administrator role tier alongside the human role tiers.

